{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12906","headline":"送田明府归终南别业 · 韩翃","name":"送田明府归终南别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园此日多心赏，窗下泉流竹外云。\n近馆应逢沈道士，比邻自识卞田君。\n离宫树影登山见，上苑钟声过雪闻。\n相劝早移丹凤阙，不须常恋白鸥羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}